==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Literally “of the old day”, from {{term|gamall||old|lang=is}} + {{term|dagur||day|lang=is}} (genitive ''dags''). Compare {{etyl|sv}} {{term|gammaldags|lang=sv}}.

===Adjective===
